{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Tailscale",
  "description": {
    "en": "Watch the machines of your Tailscale network: online status, updates and key expiry.",
    "fr": "Surveillez les machines de votre réseau Tailscale : connexion, mises à jour, clés.",
    "de": "Überwache die Geräte deines Tailscale-Netzes: Verbindung, Updates und Schlüssel.",
    "es": "Supervise las máquinas de su red Tailscale: conexión, actualizaciones y claves."
  },
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/prohand/gladys-tailscale:1.0.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=5.1.0",
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/prohand/gladys-tailscale/main/cover.png",
  "categories": ["network", "security"],
  "transports": ["cloud"],
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "intro",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Getting started",
        "fr": "Pour commencer",
        "de": "Erste Schritte",
        "es": "Primeros pasos"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The integration reads your tailnet through the Tailscale API, in the cloud: nothing to install on your machines. Create an API access token (Settings → Keys, it expires after 90 days at most) or, better, an OAuth client with the \"devices:core\" scope (Settings → OAuth clients, it never expires), then paste it below.",
        "fr": "L'intégration lit votre tailnet via l'API Tailscale, dans le cloud : rien à installer sur vos machines. Créez un jeton d'accès API (Settings → Keys, il expire au plus tard après 90 jours) ou, mieux, un client OAuth avec le droit « devices:core » (Settings → OAuth clients, il n'expire jamais), puis collez-le ci-dessous.",
        "de": "Die Integration liest dein Tailnet über die Tailscale-API in der Cloud: Auf deinen Geräten muss nichts installiert werden. Erstelle ein API-Zugriffstoken (Settings → Keys, es läuft nach höchstens 90 Tagen ab) oder besser einen OAuth-Client mit dem Bereich „devices:core“ (Settings → OAuth clients, er läuft nie ab) und füge ihn unten ein.",
        "es": "La integración lee su tailnet a través de la API de Tailscale, en la nube: no hay nada que instalar en sus máquinas. Cree un token de acceso API (Settings → Keys, caduca como máximo a los 90 días) o, mejor, un cliente OAuth con el permiso «devices:core» (Settings → OAuth clients, nunca caduca) y péguelo abajo."
      },
      "links": [
        {
          "url": "https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/keys",
          "label": {
            "en": "API access tokens",
            "fr": "Jetons d'accès API",
            "de": "API-Zugriffstokens",
            "es": "Tokens de acceso API"
          }
        },
        {
          "url": "https://login.tailscale.com/admin/settings/oauth",
          "label": {
            "en": "OAuth clients",
            "fr": "Clients OAuth",
            "de": "OAuth-Clients",
            "es": "Clientes OAuth"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "auth_method",
      "type": "select",
      "label": {
        "en": "Sign-in method",
        "fr": "Méthode de connexion",
        "de": "Anmeldemethode",
        "es": "Método de conexión"
      },
      "required": true,
      "default": "api_key",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "api_key",
          "label": {
            "en": "API access token",
            "fr": "Jeton d'accès API",
            "de": "API-Zugriffstoken",
            "es": "Token de acceso API"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "oauth",
          "label": {
            "en": "OAuth client (never expires)",
            "fr": "Client OAuth (n'expire jamais)",
            "de": "OAuth-Client (läuft nie ab)",
            "es": "Cliente OAuth (nunca caduca)"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "api_key",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "API access token",
        "fr": "Jeton d'accès API",
        "de": "API-Zugriffstoken",
        "es": "Token de acceso API"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Only for the \"API access token\" method.",
        "fr": "Uniquement pour la méthode « Jeton d'accès API ».",
        "de": "Nur für die Methode „API-Zugriffstoken“.",
        "es": "Solo para el método «Token de acceso API»."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "tskey-api-…",
        "fr": "tskey-api-…",
        "de": "tskey-api-…",
        "es": "tskey-api-…"
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "oauth_client_id",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "OAuth client ID",
        "fr": "ID du client OAuth",
        "de": "Client-ID des OAuth-Clients",
        "es": "ID del cliente OAuth"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Only for the \"OAuth client\" method.",
        "fr": "Uniquement pour la méthode « Client OAuth ».",
        "de": "Nur für die Methode „OAuth-Client“.",
        "es": "Solo para el método «Cliente OAuth»."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "e.g. k1a2b3c4d5CNTRL",
        "fr": "ex. k1a2b3c4d5CNTRL",
        "de": "z. B. k1a2b3c4d5CNTRL",
        "es": "p. ej. k1a2b3c4d5CNTRL"
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "oauth_client_secret",
      "type": "secret",
      "label": {
        "en": "OAuth client secret",
        "fr": "Secret du client OAuth",
        "de": "Secret des OAuth-Clients",
        "es": "Secreto del cliente OAuth"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "tskey-client-…",
        "fr": "tskey-client-…",
        "de": "tskey-client-…",
        "es": "tskey-client-…"
      },
      "required": false
    },
    {
      "key": "tailnet",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Tailnet",
        "fr": "Tailnet",
        "de": "Tailnet",
        "es": "Tailnet"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Leave \"-\" for the tailnet of the token. Otherwise its ID, shown in Settings → General.",
        "fr": "Laissez « - » pour le tailnet du jeton. Sinon son ID, affiché dans Settings → General.",
        "de": "Lass „-“ für das Tailnet des Tokens stehen. Sonst seine ID aus Settings → General.",
        "es": "Deje «-» para la tailnet del token. Si no, su ID, visible en Settings → General."
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "-",
        "fr": "-",
        "de": "-",
        "es": "-"
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": "-"
    },
    {
      "key": "poll_frequency",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Refresh interval (s)",
        "fr": "Intervalle de rafraîchissement (s)",
        "de": "Aktualisierungsintervall (s)",
        "es": "Intervalo de actualización (s)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "How often the tailnet is read, in seconds. One request per refresh, whatever the number of machines.",
        "fr": "Fréquence de lecture du tailnet, en secondes. Une requête par lecture, quel que soit le nombre de machines.",
        "de": "Wie oft das Tailnet gelesen wird, in Sekunden. Eine Anfrage pro Abfrage, egal wie viele Geräte.",
        "es": "Cada cuánto se lee la tailnet, en segundos. Una petición por lectura, sea cual sea el número de máquinas."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 60,
      "min": 30,
      "max": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "key_expiry_warning_days",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Key expiry warning (days)",
        "fr": "Alerte d'expiration des clés (jours)",
        "de": "Warnung vor Schlüsselablauf (Tage)",
        "es": "Aviso de caducidad de claves (días)"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A machine whose key expires within this many days fires the \"Key expiring soon\" trigger.",
        "fr": "Une machine dont la clé expire dans ce délai déclenche « Clé bientôt expirée ».",
        "de": "Ein Gerät, dessen Schlüssel in dieser Frist abläuft, löst „Schlüssel läuft bald ab“ aus.",
        "es": "Una máquina cuya clave caduca en este plazo activa «Clave a punto de caducar»."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": 14,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 90
    },
    {
      "key": "include_external",
      "type": "boolean",
      "label": {
        "en": "Include machines shared with you",
        "fr": "Inclure les machines partagées avec vous",
        "de": "Mit dir geteilte Geräte einbeziehen",
        "es": "Incluir las máquinas compartidas con usted"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Machines another tailnet shares into yours. Hidden by default: they are not yours to manage.",
        "fr": "Les machines qu'un autre tailnet partage avec le vôtre. Masquées par défaut : vous ne les gérez pas.",
        "de": "Geräte, die ein anderes Tailnet mit deinem teilt. Standardmäßig ausgeblendet: Du verwaltest sie nicht.",
        "es": "Máquinas que otra tailnet comparte con la suya. Ocultas por defecto: usted no las administra."
      },
      "required": false,
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "key": "test_connection",
      "label": {
        "en": "Test the connection",
        "fr": "Tester la connexion",
        "de": "Verbindung testen",
        "es": "Probar la conexión"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Reads the tailnet now and lists its machines in the Discovery tab.",
        "fr": "Lit le tailnet maintenant et liste ses machines dans l'onglet Découverte.",
        "de": "Liest das Tailnet sofort und listet seine Geräte im Tab „Entdecken“ auf.",
        "es": "Lee la tailnet ahora y muestra sus máquinas en la pestaña Descubrimiento."
      },
      "timeout_seconds": 30
    }
  ],
  "scene_triggers": [
    {
      "key": "connection_changed",
      "label": {
        "en": "Machine online or offline",
        "fr": "Machine en ligne ou hors ligne",
        "de": "Gerät online oder offline",
        "es": "Máquina en línea o sin conexión"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A machine of the tailnet connected or disconnected.",
        "fr": "Une machine du tailnet s'est connectée ou déconnectée.",
        "de": "Ein Gerät des Tailnets hat sich verbunden oder getrennt.",
        "es": "Una máquina de la tailnet se conectó o desconectó."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "device",
          "type": "select",
          "source": "devices",
          "label": {
            "en": "Machine",
            "fr": "Machine",
            "de": "Gerät",
            "es": "Máquina"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "state",
          "type": "select",
          "label": {
            "en": "New state",
            "fr": "Nouvel état",
            "de": "Neuer Zustand",
            "es": "Nuevo estado"
          },
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "online",
              "label": {
                "en": "Online",
                "fr": "En ligne",
                "de": "Online",
                "es": "En línea"
              }
            },
            {
              "value": "offline",
              "label": {
                "en": "Offline",
                "fr": "Hors ligne",
                "de": "Offline",
                "es": "Sin conexión"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variables": [
        {
          "key": "device_name",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Machine name",
            "fr": "Nom de la machine",
            "de": "Gerätename",
            "es": "Nombre de la máquina"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "state",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "New state",
            "fr": "Nouvel état",
            "de": "Neuer Zustand",
            "es": "Nuevo estado"
          }
        },
        {
          "key": "ip",
          "type": "string",
          "label": {
            "en": "Tailscale IP",
